5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that is fair but doesn't alienate newcomers. I suggest we look at the taster evening forms and the sign-up records for mid-year joiners.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I agree we need data. I'm interested in the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the bank statements on last year's renewals to see the administrative burden.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I'd like to see the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record to understand who is actually using the club.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I want to know why people are hesitant. I'll check the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We can't just guess the numbers again. I'm looking at last year's ledger of outgoings and the bank statements on last year's renewals.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
