30,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"It seems many potential members are deterred by a full year's commitment upfront. Also, mid-year joins are a manual headache.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The treasurer's workload is skewed; chasing individual payments is a nightmare compared to a single annual collection.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The imbalance is stark. A tiny fraction of us do all the work and attend everything, while some pay and never show.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Charging for specific events seems to have killed the habit of attending weekday meetings. People stopped feeling they belonged.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Most of our costs are fixed—hall hire and insurance. We can't afford to let the income drop based on turnout.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, if costs are fixed, a flat fee is safest, but @Benjamin mentioned the payment struggle.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,Exactly. Many members struggle to pay a lump sum and need reminders or installments.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,But is it fair that the few of us doing the heavy lifting pay the same as those who never appear?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, if we make it too transactional, we lose the community feel. The summer outings proved that.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Takumi,,We need a guaranteed sum. Guessing is what got us into this mess last year.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we go too complex, we just increase the treasurer's workload, which @Benjamin highlighted.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. Any system that requires chasing money every week is a non-starter for the next treasurer.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,Perhaps a middle ground? Something that acknowledges different levels of use without being a bookkeeping nightmare.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm wary of anything that makes a member ""weigh up"" whether to attend a session.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"As long as the fixed costs are covered first, I'm open to suggestions.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Asuka,,We must balance the ease of joining with the stability of the budget.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Logic suggests we minimize the number of transactions.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,And maximize the perceived fairness.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,And protect the social atmosphere.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Takumi,,Let's see the options.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
